    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a Shadow Ninja, tasked with assassinating all hostile ninjas on the battlefield. Eliminate every enemy to clear the level. The Shadow Ninja specializes in high-speed dash attacks. During an attack, enemy movements appear extremely slow to you, as if time itself has stopped. However, such powerful strikes consume stamina, and if your stamina or health reaches zero, your ninja career will come to an end!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics: when dashing into a wall, you can instantly perform another dash, enabling stylish and seamless combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also forcibly stop dashing mid-attack to hover in the air, allowing you to adjust your position for the perfect strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy smooth and fluid controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple beautifully crafted levels with a shadowy aesthetic.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a Shadow Ninja, tasked with assassinating all hostile ninjas on the battlefield. Eliminate every enemy to clear the level. The Shadow Ninja specializes in high-speed dash attacks. During an attack, enemy movements appear extremely slow to you, as if time itself has stopped. However, such powerful strikes consume stamina, and if your stamina or health reaches zero, your ninja career will come to an end!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics: when dashing into a wall, you can instantly perform another dash, enabling stylish and seamless combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also forcibly stop dashing mid-attack to hover in the air, allowing you to adjust your position for the perfect strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy smooth and fluid controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple beautifully crafted levels with a shadowy aesthetic.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become a nimble shadow ninja and experience the thrill of assassinating enemies at lightning speed!",
